    98→    //    pre-finalization or conflicting with finalization.
    99→    // 2. The parent is unknown to us, we probably want to download it since it might actually
   100→    //    descend from the finalized root.
   101→    // (Non-Lighthouse): Since we prune all blocks non-descendant from finalized checking the `db.block` database won't be useful to guard
   102→    // against known bad fork blocks, so we throw PARENT_UNKNOWN for cases (1) and (2)
